[LINK: (English) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_Wikipedia]  (10.7%)

[LINK: (Cebuano) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cebuano_Wikipedia]  (9.20%)

[LINK: (German) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_Wikipedia]  (4.70%)

[LINK: (French) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_Wikipedia]  (4.10%)

[LINK: (Swedish) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swedish_Wikipedia]  (3.90%)

[LINK: (Dutch) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dutch_Wikipedia]  (3.30%)

[LINK: (Spanish) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spanish_Wikipedia]  (3.10%)

[LINK: (Russian) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russian_Wikipedia]  (3.10%)

[LINK: (Italian) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Italian_Wikipedia]  (2.90%)

[LINK: (Polish) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polish_Wikipedia]  (2.50%)

[LINK: (Egyptian Arabic) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Egyptian_Arabic_Wikipedia]  (2.50%)

[LINK: (Chinese) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_Wikipedia]  (2.30%)

[LINK: (Japanese) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_Wikipedia]  (2.20%)

