[LINK: (Stix, Gary) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gary_Stix] , "Wiki-Curious: Are you a 'busybody,' a 'hunter" or a 'dancer'?",  [LINK: (Scientific American) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scientific_American] , vol. 332, no. 2 (February 2025), p. 18. "'Curiosity actually works by connecting pieces of information, not just acquiring them.'"

